`crates/core/src/import_map.rs` — a data structure that, given a fully-merged `GlobalSourceData`, allows the resolver to answer: "in file F, the name N was imported — what file and canonical name does it refer to?"

### Key types to implement

```rust
use camino::{Utf8Path, Utf8PathBuf};
use compact_str::CompactString;
use rustc_hash::FxHashMap;
use crate::types::*;

pub struct ImportResolutionMap {
    /// (consuming_file, local_name) → specifier + original exported name
    /// Note: we store the specifier string, not the resolved file path.
    /// The resolver calls oxc_resolver to turn specifiers into paths.
    bindings: FxHashMap<(Utf8PathBuf, CompactString), ImportRef>,
    /// barrel_file → specifiers it wildcard-re-exports from
    wildcard_sources: FxHashMap<Utf8PathBuf, Vec<String>>,
}

pub struct ImportRef {
    /// The import specifier as written: "@radix-ui/react-button", "./types", etc.
    pub specifier: String,
    /// The exported name in the source module (after `as` rename)
    pub exported_name: CompactString,
    pub is_type_only: bool,
}
```

### Methods to implement

**`ImportResolutionMap::build(global: &GlobalSourceData) -> Self`**
- Iterate `global.import_map` (file → Vec<ImportBinding>)
- For each binding, insert into `self.bindings` keyed by `(file_path, local_name)`
- For `global.re_export_map`, collect `ReExportAll` entries into `wildcard_sources`

**`find_import(&self, file: &Utf8Path, local_name: &str) -> Option<&ImportRef>`**
- Simple lookup in `self.bindings`
- Returns None if the name is locally defined (not imported)

**`resolve_reexport_chain(&self, barrel_file: &Utf8Path, exported_name: &str, global: &GlobalSourceData) -> Option<ReExportStep>`**
- Walk `global.re_export_map` for `barrel_file`
- Match `ReExportNamed { local_name, source_name, source_specifier }` where `local_name == exported_name`
- Match `ReExportAll { source_specifier }` — record all wildcard sources for the caller to check
- Return `ReExportStep` indicating what was found:

```rust
pub enum ReExportStep {
    /// Found a named re-export — caller resolves specifier to a file and recurses
    Named { source_specifier: String, source_name: String },
    /// Found one or more wildcard re-exports — caller checks each
    Wildcards(Vec<String>),
}
