Now I can see the real patterns across all six libraries. Let me map out what we actually face.

---

## Concrete Patterns From The Fixtures

### Pattern 1 — `Omit<T, K>` in extends (Chakra)
```ts
// Chakra Button.d.ts line 47
type HTMLChakraProps<Tag extends React.ElementType> =
