gradient?: {
  from: string
  to: string
  deg?: number
}
```
An anonymous inline object type as a prop value. Currently stored as raw string. Should become `PropType::Object(vec![...])`.

### Pattern 10 — Partial applied to sub-component props (MUI TextField)
```ts
