| Conditional types? | ✅ (slow) | ❌ Opaque | ✅ (cached after first) |

The critical insight: we're **better than RDT on accuracy for complex types** once the cache is warm, and dramatically faster on every run because we only use the type checker as a targeted oracle for edge cases.

