   - `git stash`/`git stash pop` mtime-staleness pitfall: after a stash-pop restoring code, `cargo build --release` can report "0 crates compiled" (a false-positive "nothing changed" signal) even though real content differs — must `touch` the affected files immediately after any stash/pop before rebuilding, to force a genuine recompilation, when doing rigorous before/after diagnostic comparisons.
