       ```
       (changed only the final return statement from `ResolvedChain::default()` to `ResolvedChain::empty_with_compose(base.to_raw_string())`, plus the explanatory comment above it).

   - **`crates/core/src/pipeline/mod.rs`** — added a new test (placed immediately before `test_same_display_name_across_files_with_identical_stem_does_not_collide`, after the SVGAttributes test):
     ```rust
     // ── test_unresolvable_intersection_member_records_raw_type_in_composes ────
     //
     // `resolve_base_as_chain`'s final match arm (conditional types, mapped types,
