Return your findings via the required schema.`,
  },
  {
    name: 'panic-containment',
    prompt: `${CONTEXT}

Your cluster: panic/crash/hang containment gaps — places where a panic, unbounded allocation, or hang isn't isolated to the smallest reasonable blast radius.

Findings assigned to this cluster (verify against the actual code): plugin hook panics unwinding out of pipeline::extract() with zero catch_unwind anywhere in the repo (plugin.rs, pipeline/mod.rs:293,385); per-file parse/resolve rayon batches having no per-file catch_unwind (pipeline/mod.rs:260,357); watch.rs's poisoned-mutex .expect() permanently disabling a session (pipeline/watch.rs:93); LSP Content-Length unbounded allocation (cli/commands/lsp.rs:36); LSP hover advertised but unimplemented causing a client hang (cli/commands/lsp.rs:56,78); LSP malformed-header desync risk (cli/commands/lsp.rs:32-34); unbounded template-literal Cartesian product (resolver/template.rs:94-104); extractor's bracket-counting nesting guard not actually bounding conditional-type-chain recursion depth (extractor/mod.rs:38-40,105-120,311-471); NAPI create_session/close_session running unprotected on the JS thread unlike the other three entry points (crates/binding/src/lib.rs:132-138,193-195).

