${JSON.stringify(clusterResults.filter(Boolean), null, 2)}

Read /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/edge-cases.md and /Users/gabe/Projects/oxc-react-codegen/docs/adr/README.md yourself to cross-check.

Produce a final Phase 0 report as markdown (this will be shown directly to the user and used to drive Phase 1 implementation planning). Structure:

